# UNDERDELVE: ore comes from chests you strike open, loose gems, and miner's
# shrines that open once their room is clear. Foes drop nothing.
game underdelve
wait 10
wait 5
cheat no_gloom
cheat room 7 4 242 34
cheat clear_enemies
wait 20
press B
wait 20
expect money == 50
cheat room 2 5 150 60
cheat clear_enemies
wait 20
hold RIGHT 20
wait 20
expect money == 150
cheat room 1 5 30 130
wait 5
expect money == 150
cheat clear_enemies
wait 5
expect money == 250
